   $ & C_h = \( K_h + Q^(*) Q \)^(- 1) \, wide K_h sans(P)_h = Q^(*) K_(h + 1) \, wide I - Q sans(P)_h = K_(h + 1) \,\
 & sans(P)_h 1 = 1 \, wide sans(P)_h \( upright("centered affine field") \) = upright("its affine extension") \,\
